# Copy to `.dev.vars` and fill in. `wrangler dev` reads `.dev.vars` automatically.
#
# No values are required for local development:
#   - the D1 binding is auto-created as a local SQLite file, and
#   - the API falls back to an in-memory store if the DB binding is ever missing.
#
# Optional overrides:
#
# Point the browser client at a different API origin. Defaults to same-origin
# (the Pages site itself). Set this to e.g. your deployed URL if the static
# assets and API live on different hosts:
# __API_BASE__=https://share-rotate-qrcode.pages.dev
#
# Optional secret that gates the manual sweep endpoint (POST /api/sweep).
# Without it, /api/sweep is disabled.
# SWEEP_SECRET=change-me
